- which of those lessons reached the skills (`.claude/skills/coordinator/`, `.claude/skills/fortress-repo/`), by commit.

Write your file yourself to `explorations/coordinator/postmortem-2026-10-28/evidence/last-consolidation.md` (make the folder). Cite every item by commit hash, file path with heading, or transcript timestamp. Quote exactly; never paraphrase a quote. Keep the file under 20K characters. End your turn with the path and a summary of at most 10 lines.

